Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 17:06:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 075/101] MAS local: use the dark navigation palette

Apply the fixed #20212D MuMu-style palette to the title bar, navigation column, and container, with light controls and DWM colors. Keep the third-review shutdown and zoom corrections in the same build.

Change-Id: I9c4e2a7b0d6f1a3c5e8b2d4f7a9c0e1b3d5f6a8
---
